{{ja-kanjitab|こおり|yomi=k|alt=凍り,冰:uncommon}}
{{wp|lang=ja}}
{{wp|Ice}}
[[File:Block if ice in Jökulsarlon Iceland.JPG|thumb|right|{{m|ja||氷|tr=kōri}}: a block of '''ice'''.]]

